                                        "entry_id": "51b4ca04-4dd2-3897-8ec2-34a3f95c7b80",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To adopt the obelisk posture; to point the tip of the abdomen towards the sun."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a dragonfly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b667fab3-5b5e-40a3-9d6b-e5b0c3608c06",
                                                "sense_id": "940f8d79-2fca-38a6-b83c-f7e7d505dc39",
                                                "text": "Dragonflies that spend the day in full sun may obelisk to minimize the sunlight striking the body. An obelisking dragonfly looks like it's doing a headstand[…]"
